<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Combat Experience Table - SorcRPG</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <style>
    body {
      background: #f6f7f9;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0 0 40px 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px #e0e0e0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 32px;
    }
    h1 {
      color: #006064;
      margin-bottom: 0.5em;
    }
    p {
      color: #333;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 1em;
    }
    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 1em;
    }
    th, td {
      border: 1px solid #bbb;
      padding: 10px 8px;
      text-align: center;
      min-width: 70px;
    }
    th {
      background-color: #d0d0d0;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .monster-common { background-color: #e0f7fa; }
    .monster-uncommon { background-color: #b2ebf2; }
    .monster-rare { background-color: #80deea; }
    .monster-unique { background-color: #4dd0e1; }
    .monster-heroic { background-color: #26c6da; }
    .monster-elite { background-color: #00bcd4; }
    .monster-legendary { background-color: #0097a7; color: #fff; }
    .monster-divine { background-color: #006064; color: #fff; }

    .rank-pauper { background-color: #fffde7; }
    .rank-peasant { background-color: #fff9c4; }
    .rank-commoner { background-color: #ffe082; }
    .rank-adventurer { background-color: #ffd54f; }
    .rank-hero { background-color: #ffb300; }
    .rank-elite { background-color: #ff8a65; }
    .rank-master { background-color: #d7ccc8; }
    .rank-legend { background-color: #bdbdbd; }

    .xp-boost { background-color: #fff59d; font-weight: bold;}
    .xp-null { background-color: #ffcdd2; color: #c62828; font-weight: bold; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .container { padding: 8px; }
      table { font-size: 0.9em; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Combat Experience Table</h1>
    <p>
      Use this table to determine XP rewards for defeating monsters in SorcRPG. Impossible or trivial encounters, shaded red and marked as <strong>null</strong>, grant no experience. Barely possible victories grant a significant XP boost (yellow). Standard and reduced XP are awarded for appropriately challenging or easier encounters, respectively.
    </p>
    <table>
      <tr>
        <th>Rank</th>
        <th class="monster-common">Common (1)</th>
        <th class="monster-uncommon">Uncommon (2)</th>
        <th class="monster-rare">Rare (3)</th>
        <th class="monster-unique">Unique (4)</th>
        <th class="monster-heroic">Heroic (5)</th>
        <th class="monster-elite">Elite (6)</th>
        <th class="monster-legendary">Legendary (7)</th>
        <th class="monster-divine">Divine (8)</th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="rank-pauper">Pauper (1)</th>
        <td>10</td>
        <td>20</td>
        <td>30</td>
        <td>40</td>
        <td class="xp-boost">250</td>
        <td class="xp-boost">300</td>
        <td class="xp-boost">350</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="rank-peasant">Peasant (2)</th>
        <td>8</td>
        <td>16</td>
        <td>24</td>
        <td class="xp-boost">120</td>
        <td class="xp-boost">200</td>
        <td class="xp-boost">240</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="rank-commoner">Commoner (3)</th>
        <td>6</td>
        <td>12</td>
        <td class="xp-boost">90</td>
        <td class="xp-boost">160</td>
        <td class="xp-boost">200</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="rank-adventurer">Adventurer (4)</th>
        <td>4</td>
        <td class="xp-boost">60</td>
        <td class="xp-boost">120</td>
        <td class="xp-boost">160</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="rank-hero">Hero (5)</th>
        <td>2</td>
        <td class="xp-boost">40</td>
        <td class="xp-boost">60</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="rank-elite">Elite (6)</th>
        <td>1</td>
        <td class="xp-boost">20</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="rank-master">Master (7)</th>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="rank-legend">Legend (8)</th>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
        <td class="xp-null">null</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    <p style="margin-top: 2em; color: #555;">
      <strong>Color Legend:</strong> <span style="background:#fff59d; padding:2px 6px;">Yellow</span> = XP boost; <span style="background:#ffcdd2; padding:2px 6px;">Red</span> = Impossible/trivial (null); <span style="background:#e0f7fa; padding:2px 6px;">Blue</span> = Monster rank; <span style="background:#fffde7; padding:2px 6px;">Light yellow</span> = Character rank.
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
